sentences.text:
Hence, the following:
ORDER (i) The appeal is allowed in part;
(ii) The petitioners are entitled to an enhanced compensation of Rs.4,90,000/- along with interest at the rate of 6% p.a. from the date of petition before the Tribunal till realization which shall be over and above what has been awarded by the Tribunal;
(iii) Petitioner No.1 shall be entitled to the enhanced compensation.

